{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|3F9CEEED41DD4E5EDA324EBA13E7B5C5", "source_en": "What you want?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ماذا تريد؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|406354564F83AE77BE725DA0F58FE2E7", "source_en": "Hmm. This pup good at fetch.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "همم. هذا الجرو جيد في الإحضار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|40D1ABCE4EE739802648A083BFE68C57", "source_en": "Here, kill many hell creature. Make Gajov proud.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ، اقتل كثير من مخلوقات الجحيم. اجعل قاجوف فخوراً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4100DB824B1643A3AD28FC84B724844D", "source_en": "Go now.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اذهب الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4386CB1B421BDA210834BF8AB84BE67E", "source_en": "Gajov take.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يأخذ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4C0CD0F44CAF36668FA36A811A082D72", "source_en": "Gajov like pup.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يحب الجرو.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4C44C2CF49C93AAC5A578FA98AC9D44A", "source_en": "Strong one.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قوي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4D2674494F017A028A5EF79C3CF1C51F", "source_en": "Here, Gajov make very special toys for good pup.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هنا، قاجوف يصنع ألعاب خاصة جداً للجرو الطيب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4D4894014D867155105D9D98020BE7A1", "source_en": "Gallant won't like this. Gallant hate Valahk-Nor.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قالانت لن يعجب بهذا. قالانت يكره ڤالاك-نور.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4D4E38BA4F63EACBF4CB27BEE236128E", "source_en": "Here. No show Gallant. Bad memories.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ. لا تظهر هذا لقالانت. ذكريات سيئة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4D6E29B0422197427C9710950C38FBD6", "source_en": "Bring Gajov material, Gajov forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر مواد لقاجوف، قاجوف يصهر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4D9F535544F8E9AAA3024F867687436B", "source_en": "This take time. Pup come back later.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هذا يأخذ وقتاً. الجرو يعود لاحقاً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|4F7626C54D35DE105FAA18AA86357CA1", "source_en": "Back to work.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "عودة للعمل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5016FD934BA26E5B2C15E5861202DE93", "source_en": "Friend. What is it?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "صديق. ما الأمر؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|509A06EA4EE2A7B338C4E3872BBADE54", "source_en": "Obsidian black. More strong than iron.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أسود أوبسيديان. أقوى من حديد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5133006D440C82BF1EAA6AAC7A5EFB4E", "source_en": "Come, enjoy Gajov's forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تعال، استمتع بفرن قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|519968744EE96E2E15BB579A6E16361E", "source_en": "For head.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "للرأس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5328867B457DF99C151715BCA3103488", "source_en": "Now go.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "الآن اذهب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|54297EFD47A1CB5E48F52497BF5558DD", "source_en": "Help you don't die.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يساعدك لا تموت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|555C5F444AA0D788304D03AED4B98A3A", "source_en": "Fine.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حسن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|574A47BD4FDABB1902A74598E34A128D", "source_en": "Yes.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "نعم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5B6596FE4A0CC16A07E4DAB583451AD4", "source_en": "Sword dull. Give to Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "سيف ثلم. أعطِ لقاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5E0F6E4748C9F03D66C134A772A8A261", "source_en": "Dragon bones were highly sought after by Karsivites. Allow Gajov to show you why.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "عظام تنين مطلوبة جداً عند الكارسيفيت. دع قاجوف يريك السبب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5E62972B440CBC2824DCE2B7830F4E01", "source_en": "Bring Gajov what he need and Gajov help.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر لقاجوف ما يحتاج وقاجوف يساعد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5F7157AA4B7C837890A33C8A7C91539A", "source_en": "Keep blood inside.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "دم يبقى بالداخل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|5FE8FF5D4981A0DEEC177BAD12F049AF", "source_en": "Bring Gajov what he need and Gajov help.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "جلب لقاجوف ما يحتاج وقاجوف يساعد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6267B11449A8FF361909A884CC0B33B1", "source_en": "This one for killing.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هذا للقتل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|638683F645BC0A8A8ACD18B49903FC39", "source_en": "(grunt)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6551273F46A9C7B5B2BC088EC5E88614", "source_en": "Good pup. Now, buy new toy. Kill gods.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "جرو جيد. الآن، جلب لعبة جديدة. قتل آلهة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|66FD2EAA45F9CAE3113632B4E960BF65", "source_en": "Good pup. Bring Gajov better material. Gajov make better fire.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "جرو جيد. جلب لقاجوف مواد أفضل. قاجوف يصنع نار أفضل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|694E557641175521849E68B5772DF6ED", "source_en": "Here, take list. Go fetch.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ القائمة. اذهب وأحضرها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6A292C3348B908CA026C6B83DEA479CC", "source_en": "Don't die.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا تمت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6A7E3DC14D9A26B02EE594AEB75CF1D5", "source_en": "Gajov glad to see nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف سعيد برؤية نيفليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6B47D14D48A5E0593F7544932D78CB07", "source_en": "What is it, pup?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ما الأمر، أيها الجرو؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6C36C47A432885ACB87E9D8BB4B262BD", "source_en": "It only way.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هذا هو الطريق الوحيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6E1091AD4A379D642F9752B0531D8110", "source_en": "Only look. No touch.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "انظر فقط. لا تلمس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6EC5A0314E5B4F4ED775ABA99F429676", "source_en": "Trust Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ثق بقاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|6EE9233B451A7ACA273F23AFE383D233", "source_en": "Now Lady Vodor help you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "الآن سيدة ڤودور تساعدك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|70E8F6AE4477922AAF9693AE2CADA214", "source_en": "Come, let us see what this flame can do.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تعال، لنرَ ماذا تفعل هذه الشعلة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|715B3F0F4485E6FB61167E914A64BE7F", "source_en": "Good pup.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "جرو جيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|71A80294445AAE80996F39A2103CE483", "source_en": "Need ore.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "نحتاج خام.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|739C1B83498BBC92D66B7CAADF0D9214", "source_en": "Bring steel?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تجلب فولاذ؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|740BB1CE4E11A6CA348961B50261147C", "source_en": "Trust Gajov's forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ثق بفرجة قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|7457935B4673E7B8A946689188E000AC", "source_en": "Can't.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا يمكن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|7654A03143313E599EA53887D2B3F95A", "source_en": "Gajov no need but Gajov take.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف لا يحتاج، لكن قاجوف يأخذ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|77E0C67F40F327A017CD8FBF826B1DFE", "source_en": "That armor get you killed! Let Gajov see.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هذا الدرع يقتلك! دع قاجوف يرى.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|77FC19E845F93634F1855EB44E34E342", "source_en": "Gajov bored. Every day same fire.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف ملول. كل يوم نفس النار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|7B526DF7445F4782EC41E5BAD0DE78E3", "source_en": "For killing.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "للقتل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|7C8986814B0198FA26B8748057B50D0B", "source_en": "Hmm?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "همم؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
