{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|7EBCA3DB47A3020A362A9DA9EB13B651", "source_en": "Gajov need much infernal energy or no reforge for Lady Mereda.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يحتاج طاقة جهنمية كثيرة أو لا إعادة صهر للسيدة ميريدا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
